  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Early Bird Special</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: easy <u>down the hall</u> glossary dance with <u>chain</u></h2>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/107\">Tom Calwell</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: improper </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors balance &amp; swing, end facing down</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">down the hall and turn alone</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">up the hall and bend into a ring</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">right left through</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles chain to neighbor, look to the next ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
